        "text": "<p>Cuddles by Mia &amp; Co. started with one simple thought: <strong>baby clothes can be adorable without compromising on comfort.</strong></p><p>Growing up, I was always sensitive to certain fabrics. The cutest clothes were often the ones that felt scratchy, uncomfortable or simply not made to be worn for long. Years later, that little experience became the idea behind Cuddles.</p><p>We thoughtfully bring together clothing and everyday essentials for babies aged <strong>0–24 months</strong>, with comfort at the heart of everything we choose. From sleepy mornings and messy meals to bubbly bath times, tiny adventures and special firsts, our collection is made to be a part of the everyday moments that make childhood so special.</p><p>At Cuddles, we believe the things closest to your baby should feel <strong>soft, comfortable and made with care</strong>, while still being every bit as cute as you imagined.</p>",
